WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00.130 --> 00:05.730
Aaliyah learned that she needed to define a realistic purpose

2
00:06.210 --> 00:08.581
for the time that was given for the meeting.

3
00:08.581 --> 00:11.867
Not everything can get accomplished in 30 minutes or an hour.

4
00:11.867 --> 00:19.087
And it’s actually really important, practically speaking, that we don’t try to stuff everything and the kitchen sink into one meeting.

5
00:19.087 --> 00:21.080
It’s important to define your purpose

6
00:21.190 --> 00:27.269
clearly, and make sure that you are being realistic about what can be achieved in a given time frame.

7
00:27.269 --> 00:30.820
It’s much better to have a clear and well-directed purpose,

8
00:31.210 --> 00:33.730
where people come into the meeting understanding

9
00:34.050 --> 00:38.968
what is happening, and leave the meeting with a clear set of actions and commitments.

10
00:38.968 --> 00:44.580
You can always set up an additional meeting, or a meeting at a later time, to cover other topics.

11
00:44.930 --> 00:48.610
But trying to do too much in one meeting is just a recipe for disaster.

